# 02 - Numbers and maths, written in words or symbols

set apples to 12
set friends to 4
say "Each friend gets {apples divided by friends} apples."

say 7 plus 3
say 7 minus 3
say 7 times 3
say 7 divided by 2
say 2 to the power of 8
say 17 mod 5
say the square root of 144
say round(3.14159, 2)
say "A random dice roll: " + dice()
say "A random number from 1 to 100: " + random number from 1 to 100

set total to 0
add 10 to total
change total by 5
multiply total by 2
take 3 from total
say "total is now {total}"

say "Is 7 a prime number? " + is_prime(7)
say "12 in words: " + spell_number(12)
say "1234567 with commas: " + commas(1234567)
say "The average of 4, 8 and 15 is " + average(4, 8, 15)
